- `Stop_Fighting` PARAMS: {"target":"Actor offered the truce. This parameter expects the name of an actor. Valid Choices: 'Bob', 'Olda Windrime [bandit]', 'Trenlor [bandit]', 'Skadi'. Choose one of these actor names EXACTLY."} — [speaker] lowers their weapon and offers [target] to stop fighting. [target] decides whether to accept; if they refuse, the fight may go on.
