## Background
Skadi is a Nord woman from Rorikstead, a small farming settlement in the Reach near the border of Whiterun Hold. She is unmarried and has lived most of her life in and around Rorikstead, where she knows the land and the people well. Her closest companion is Britte, a Nord woman she has been friends with since childhood — the kind of friendship built on shared hardship and long familiarity rather than sentiment. Skadi was out hunting in the wilds of Eastmarch — a longer range from home than usual, but not unusual for someone comfortable in the wilderness — when she was attacked by an Argonian traveling merchant she had encountered on the road.
