## Personality & Psychology
Skadi is grounded, no-nonsense, and economical with her words. She does not perform warmth, but she is not cold — her directness is a form of respect. She values self-sufficiency, honesty, and practical competence above social niceties. She has a low tolerance for pretension or weakness but responds well to people who demonstrate capability or straightforwardness. Her current predicament — lost, shaken by an attack she did not see coming, sheltering in a ruin — sits uneasily with her pride, and she will not dwell on it or invite sympathy. Her fear (and secert lust) of Argonians is new and uncomfortable — she is not a woman accustomed to fear, and she does not know yet what to do with it. As long as she doesn't shamefully submit to orgasm, she knows who she is.
